.TH "JSONKIT\-MCP\-INSTALL" "1" "" "jsonkit 0.0.0" ""
.SH "NAME"
jsonkit\-mcp\-install \- Register this application\(aqs MCP server with your coding agents.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBjsonkit mcp install\fR [options]
.fi
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-agent\fR <\fIagent\fR>
The agent to register with: claude or codex. Every agent that starts when left out. One of: claude, codex.
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace a registration of this name that mcp install did not make.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBjsonkit\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-mcp\fR(1)
